  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Vocabulary of a trial",
     "texto": [
      "**Tiltalte** is the accused person before a court; a **vitne** tells what they know and a **bevis** can support an explanation.",
      "**Å anke** is asking for a court decision to be reviewed by a higher court."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two common passive forms",
     "texto": [
      "In legal texts the passive can appear with **-s**: **saken ankes** («the case is appealed»). **Bli + participle** presents the action: **personen blir frifunnet** («the person is acquitted»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
